      "paragraphs": [
        {
          "text": "Tesla watchers on X filled feeds with Cybercab ride reports as paid service spread in Austin. Sawyer Merritt said he spent about three hours in Cybercab for roughly $93 — clearly cheaper than about $200 for similar Uber trips — and that Full Self-Driving V15 felt fine on a ~40-minute ride across town. Wait times stretched past an hour once more of the public tried it, which was easy to expect: still few Cybercabs on the road and a lot of curiosity.",
          "tone": "up"
