        {
          "text": "Farzad teased a video on whether Cybercab can beat Uber. He hopes Tesla can prove the cars are safe enough to put thousands on Austin roads and widen the map so you can call one from home. Separately he kept covering AI chips and what it costs to build data centers in the U.S.",
          "tone": "flat"
